/* DealCraft — Chapter 1 · Lesson 1.12 Squeeze-outs, the Minority Menu & Deal Protections (audited Oct 2026).
   Sources: Intro 2.15, 2.17 (Ex 3); Wan Ch 8 §D [8.37]–[8.74], Ch 13, Ch 14 [14.20]–[14.79], Ch 16 [16.42]; Code (2026) r 13, Intro (schemes). */
