/* DealCraft — Chapter 3 · Lesson 3.1 The Take-Over Code & the SIC (audited Oct 2026).
   Sources: Code (2026) Introduction §§1–4 & Note on §2, General Principles 1–13; Wan Ch 3 [3.9], Ch 16 [16.11]–[16.13]; SFA s 321. */
